        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The return</i> or <i>payment in</i>
			of duties, taxes, <i><span class="en">Cassiod. Var. 2,
		24</span></i>.</div>
